    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this RTS game you will take command of an armada of combat spaceships and become the architect of mankind's last hope - an orbital station built in the heart of the universe. Your goal is to hold on for as long as possible while fending off increasingly powerful enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan the location of buildings, improve the fleet, distribute resources and make strategic decisions, on which depends not only your life, but also the fate of the entire sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Develop your own base in outer space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build and upgrade ships for defense and offense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight waves of opponents and maintain control of the situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tactical depth and intense gameplay for true strategists</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this RTS game you will take command of an armada of combat spaceships and become the architect of mankind's last hope - an orbital station built in the heart of the universe. Your goal is to hold on for as long as possible while fending off increasingly powerful enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan the location of buildings, improve the fleet, distribute resources and make strategic decisions, on which depends not only your life, but also the fate of the entire sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Develop your own base in outer space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build and upgrade ships for defense and offense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight waves of opponents and maintain control of the situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tactical depth and intense gameplay for true strategists</p>",
